TI  - Patterns of benthic algae and cyanobacteria along twin-stressor gradients of nutrients and fine sediment: a stream mesocosm experiment
T2  - FRESHWATER BIOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - agricultural runoff
KW  - ecological thresholds
KW  - multiple-stressor interaction
