TI  - Influence of bryozoan colonization on the physiology of the kelp <i>Macrocystis</i> <i>integrifolia</i> (Laminariales, Phaeophyta) from nitrogen-rich and -poor sites in Barkley Sound, British Columbia, Canada
T2  - PHYCOLOGIA
LA  - English
KW  - PHLOROTANNIN PRODUCTION
