TI  - The fluted giant clam (<i>Tridacna squamosa</i>) increases nitrate absorption and upregulates the expression of a homolog of SIALIN (H<SUP>+</SUP>:2NO<sub>3</sub><SUP>-</SUP> cotransporter) in the ctenidium during light exposure
