TI  - Extensive phenotypic plasticity of a Red Sea coral over a strong latitudinal temperature gradient suggests limited acclimatization potential to warming
T2  - SCIENTIFIC REPORTS
LA  - English
KW  - STYLOPHORA-PISTILLATA
KW  - CLIMATE-CHANGE
