TI  - Responses of the large centric diatom <i>Coscinodiscus</i> sp to interactions between warming, elevated CO<sub>2</sub>, and nitrate availability
T2  - LIMNOLOGY AND OCEANOGRAPHY
LA  - English
KW  - SETO INLAND SEA
KW  - OCEAN ACIDIFICATION
