TI  - Trophic niche separation that facilitates co-existence of high and low microbial abundance sponges is revealed by in situ study of carbon and nitrogen fluxes
T2  - LIMNOLOGY AND OCEANOGRAPHY
LA  - English
KW  - DISSOLVED ORGANIC-MATTER
KW  - BAIKALS LITTORAL-ZONE
