TI  - Assessing the ecological status of seagrasses using morphology, biochemical descriptors and microbial community analyses. A study in <i>Halophila stipulacea</i> (Forsk.) Aschers meadows in the northern Red Sea
T2  - ECOLOGICAL INDICATORS
