TI  - Seasonal variation in rates of heterotrophic nitrogen fixation (acetylene reduction) in Zostera noltii meadows and uncolonised sediments of the Bassin d'Arcachon, south-west France
T2  - HYDROBIOLOGIA
LA  - English
KW  - acetylene reduction
